1
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,299
"My Rival and Me"

2
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,500
(Episode 8)

3
00:00:50,139 --> 00:00:52,799
Gu Yiliang and I really...

4
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:57,880
This bromance has gone terribly wrong.

5
00:00:58,799 --> 00:01:00,359
Wait a second.

6
00:01:00,439 --> 00:01:02,520
What if Gu Yiliang blacked out last night?

7
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,319
What if he sobers up
and calls it an accident?

8
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,760
What if I lose control

9
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:08,959
and drop him out the window
in the name of Galileo?

10
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:12,480
I'm already losing it.

11
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:29,280
You're up.

12
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:39,599
Good morning, Yanyan.

13
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:41,040
Morning.

14
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:43,760
You know you can't hold your liquor.

15
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,439
Why did you drink so much?

16
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:50,879
If we don't drink,
the good stuff goes to waste.

17
00:01:51,159 --> 00:01:54,760
If we don't get wasted,
who'll sleep on the curb?

18
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:57,760
You didn't even miss a beat. Bravo.

19
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,000
Mingming, be on your best behavior.

20
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,719
Toast them all, especially Mr. Cheng.

21
00:02:22,759 --> 00:02:24,879
You want to make it? Tonight's your shot.

22
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:26,159
Wait.

23
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:29,038
- Weren't we meeting a director?
- What director?

24
00:02:29,039 --> 00:02:30,079
No clout, no contacts.

25
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,919
- I won't.
- As if.

26
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,840
Don't push your luck.

27
00:02:31,841 --> 00:02:33,319
I told you I'm not going.

28
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,680
What's your problem?

29
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:36,479
Hey,

30
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:37,799
I'll fix my makeup first.

31
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,039
You're such a hassle.

32
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,080
Make it quick.

33
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,680
Damn pimp.

34
00:02:49,759 --> 00:02:50,800
Mr. Cheng, my ass.

35
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,520
Some bald old guy, I bet.

36
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
I'm not.

37
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,120
Huh?

38
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,840
I'm not some bald old guy.

39
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:10,840
Everyone, a toast to Mr. Cheng.

40
00:03:11,765 --> 00:03:14,145
Cheers!

41
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,439
Thank you.

42
00:04:30,319 --> 00:04:31,319
What a pain.

43
00:04:39,610 --> 00:04:41,943
(The crew is taking a day off.)

44
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,800
We're on a break.

45
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,079
I'll come see you.

46
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,240
Here.

47
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,800
Hangover soup.

48
00:05:08,519 --> 00:05:09,519
No rush.

49
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,879
We have years ahead of us.

50
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,199
Let's take our time.

51
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,240
Stay covered.

52
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,680
There you go.

53
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:20,600
It's all capitalist sweet talk.

54
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:21,959
Zhu Mingming,

55
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,600
have some self-respect.

56
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,560
You fell for it once.

57
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:29,000
Are you really going to make
the same mistake twice?

58
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,120
Don't come over.

59
00:05:35,279 --> 00:05:36,560
I'm on my man period.

60
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:38,199
I finally have a day off.

61
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,199
I'm going out.

62
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,279
Don't follow me.

63
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:47,959
Yay!

64
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:51,879
Huh?

65
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,839
Why haven't I been shipping lately?

66
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,040
Wait.

67
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,720
Wei Yanzi,

68
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:03,399
your status has changed.

69
00:06:03,759 --> 00:06:05,759
You can't just pass around ship content.

70
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,040
You have to make it yourself.

71
00:06:10,112 --> 00:06:14,252
Niangzi fans, this one's for you:
"A Hint of Cool."

72
00:06:14,529 --> 00:06:16,696
[Some shmaltzy romantic post
on Weibo above an ad for milk]

73
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:24,120
I feel like I'm graduating
from the Niangzi fandom.

74
00:06:28,199 --> 00:06:32,279
Why does it reek of romance in here?

75
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,920
Oh.

76
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:37,000
It's coming from me.

77
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,360
I knocked.

78
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,480
You didn't answer.

79
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:53,600
Why do you keep kissing me?

80
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,399
The first one

81
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:57,120
was the kiss I owed you after brushing.

82
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:58,319
The second one

83
00:06:58,759 --> 00:07:01,240
was because I thought you wanted me to.

84
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,732
Just because your last name's Gu,

85
00:07:04,756 --> 00:07:07,743
the number one surname in BL,
you can do whatever you want to me?

86
00:07:07,872 --> 00:07:08,872
Yes, you can.

87
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,920
Your phone's broken.

88
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,639
I had Zhang take it in for repairs.

89
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:14,759
We have the day off.

90
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,319
I bought two movie tickets.

91
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,839
Want to go with me?

92
00:07:18,079 --> 00:07:18,759
Sure.

93
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,879
I was about to cook.

94
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,800
Why don't we eat out?

95
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,120
The cook's on duty.

96
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,519
The bank's closed.

97
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,040
Cheng Yan, you bastard.

98
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,680
Without you,

99
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:33,840
I'll make it on my own.

100
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,679
Hello, Director and Producer.

101
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:39,200
I'm Zhu Mingming, an actor.

102
00:08:39,279 --> 00:08:41,759
I'm 182 centimeters tall
and weigh 65 kilos.

103
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:43,559
I'd love to work with you.

104
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Thank you.

105
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,000
Hey.

106
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:50,199
My schedule's wide open. Any roles going?

107
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:50,799
Hey.

108
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:53,279
That role you posted about,
is it still open?

109
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,080
Can I audition?

110
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:56,000
It's fine. If it's cast, it's cast.

111
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,240
Maybe next time.

112
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:58,759
Sure, sure.

113
00:08:59,159 --> 00:09:00,639
Shave my head?

114
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,840
I can shave my head.

115
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:02,720
Sure. Absolutely.

116
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:03,559
No problem at all.

117
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:04,679
Anything for the art.

118
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:06,480
I'd look more like the character.

119
00:09:06,639 --> 00:09:07,159
Hey.

120
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,200
Any word on the supporting role
I read for?

121
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,080
Oh.

122
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,440
It's fine. Really.

123
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,320
Okay.

124
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,360
I'll let you go.

125
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,679
Next time, dinner's on me.

126
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,879
Thanks for the referral.

127
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,840
Sure, sure. Bye.

128
00:09:33,399 --> 00:09:34,840
Still never made it big.

129
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,440
I still need him.

130
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,080
Why are you here?

131
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,200
I'm talking to you.

132
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:10,000
Did you copy my key behind my back?

133
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,320
What?

134
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:14,000
Has the boss finally turned outlaw?

135
00:10:17,879 --> 00:10:18,879
This apartment?

136
00:10:19,639 --> 00:10:20,639
I bought it.

137
00:10:22,799 --> 00:10:23,799
What?

138
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,919
Hold on.

139
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,919
No wonder it's so clean.

140
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,519
After you moved in with me,

141
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:35,480
I had it cleaned every so often.

142
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,320
It's a landlord's duty.

143
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:42,799
You capitalists just pay yourselves.

144
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:44,399
I don't get to keep a cent.

145
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:46,639
So I bust my ass at work,

146
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,600
and it all goes back to you in rent?

147
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,960
Don't be mad.

148
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:09,519
Madam Landlord.

149
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,200
You...

150
00:11:17,383 --> 00:11:19,223
[The movie is about to begin]

151
00:11:39,879 --> 00:11:41,399
Why didn't you wait outside?

152
00:11:42,039 --> 00:11:43,759
I can't hold your hand out there.

153
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:45,159
I wanted to hold it in here.

154
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:48,080
How'd you know it was me in the dark?

155
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,320
Before you came in,

156
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:53,120
I grabbed a few wrong hands.

157
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:54,360
Bye.

158
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,440
Hey, hey, hey.

159
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,200
Watch this.

160
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,039
The lead's so hot in this next bit.

161
00:11:59,320 --> 00:11:59,799
Really?

162
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,840
Mm-hm.

163
00:12:15,639 --> 00:12:16,639
Hey, young man.

164
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:18,440
Showing off like a peacock, huh?

165
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:35,399
Stop.

166
00:13:35,519 --> 00:13:37,960
That's for all the times
you flirted till my brain shut down.

167
00:13:38,039 --> 00:13:39,200
Karma gets us all.

168
00:13:46,519 --> 00:13:47,600
Don't move.

169
00:13:48,159 --> 00:13:49,159
Watch the movie.

170
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,120
Behave yourself.

171
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,639
I'm a respectable man.

172
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:06,240
You're so good here. How'd you do it?

173
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,519
I deserve a kiss.

174
00:14:21,559 --> 00:14:22,799
The movie's almost over.

175
00:14:22,879 --> 00:14:24,279
Want to slip out early?

176
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,600
Sure.

177
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:32,080
Let's go.

178
00:14:34,399 --> 00:14:35,759
Did you buy popcorn?

179
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,320
I thought you bought it.

180
00:14:39,159 --> 00:14:40,240
I didn't.

181
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,240
Neither did I.

182
00:14:45,559 --> 00:14:46,799
How's the popcorn?

183
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:50,559
I've got an unopened Coke here, too.

184
00:14:50,639 --> 00:14:51,679
You can have it.

185
00:15:06,519 --> 00:15:08,720
A fan gave me that. No hugging it.

186
00:15:30,399 --> 00:15:31,480
It's so hot. So hot.

187
00:15:35,519 --> 00:15:37,039
Your clothes are way too tight.

188
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,720
Then you don't have to wear them.

189
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:42,000
You own a mansion. Why cram into my bed?

190
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,440
I'm ending the lease next month.

191
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,919
My landlord's taken over my bed.

192
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:47,639
You can't.

193
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,919
The deed's already in your name.

194
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:54,840
You what?

195
00:15:56,799 --> 00:15:58,919
You printed the contract.
Did you even read it?

196
00:15:59,639 --> 00:16:00,879
There's an extra clause.

197
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:03,679
As soon as the lease takes effect,

198
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,480
the place is yours. It's a gift.

199
00:16:19,559 --> 00:16:21,360
Now I can stop worrying you'll run off.

200
00:16:21,799 --> 00:16:23,440
At least you'll have a home to miss.

201
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:09,559
Mm.

202
00:17:12,279 --> 00:17:13,279
Mm.

203
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:16,599
Huh?

204
00:17:18,559 --> 00:17:19,640
How's that? Feel good?

205
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,720
Oh, yeah.

206
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,319
Keep it up, Gu.

207
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,519
You got it, Mr. Wei.

208
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:35,599
Cut, then turn it.

209
00:17:35,839 --> 00:17:38,319
There. Turn it again.

210
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,079
There you go. Great.

211
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:05,480
Big scene today.

212
00:18:06,079 --> 00:18:09,640
Let's nail it and wrap early.

213
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:11,359
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

214
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:15,680
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's...

215
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:19,519
That didn't help at all.

216
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:21,039
It's okay.

217
00:18:21,759 --> 00:18:22,759
I'm here with you.

218
00:18:37,599 --> 00:18:39,880
What's been going on lately
with my one true love?

219
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,400
He bolts the second we wrap.

220
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:42,880
"Something came up."

221
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:43,960
Heh.

222
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:46,160
I bet he's got someone on the side.

223
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,680
Whatever.

224
00:18:48,799 --> 00:18:49,799
Men don't matter.

225
00:18:51,559 --> 00:18:52,559
Alright.

226
00:18:52,599 --> 00:18:55,720
Let's see how
the good ship Niangzi is doing.

227
00:18:56,799 --> 00:18:58,960
I've been giving you
so much ship fuel lately,

228
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:01,640
you don't even need a microscope.

229
00:19:02,839 --> 00:19:04,119
Are you getting lazy?

230
00:19:04,279 --> 00:19:05,599
Let me check.

231
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:14,200
His fans say he's a great guy.

232
00:19:14,319 --> 00:19:15,559
They have no idea

233
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,839
he acts like a diva on set

234
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,200
and bullies newcomers.

235
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:21,640
There's another star
who's supposedly his rival.

236
00:19:21,759 --> 00:19:22,720
Well, guess what?

237
00:19:22,759 --> 00:19:25,000
He spent the whole shoot
sucking up to him.

238
00:19:25,119 --> 00:19:26,920
Probably trying to ride his coattails.

239
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,440
That's what a rich backer gets you.

240
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,799
What a schemer.

241
00:19:31,279 --> 00:19:32,839
Th-this guy...

242
00:19:34,279 --> 00:19:38,240
Gu Yiliang called him out
at the crew dinner.

243
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:41,960
He's talking about me and Gu Yiliang.

244
00:19:42,279 --> 00:19:43,279
Huh?

245
00:19:46,200 --> 00:19:47,440
Okay.

246
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,359
You come for me,

247
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:51,039
I'll judge you in silence.

248
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,480
You come for my rival,

249
00:19:52,519 --> 00:19:53,519
I'll kill you.

250
00:19:53,559 --> 00:19:55,440
Chen, get me Man.

251
00:19:55,519 --> 00:19:56,519
I've handled it.

252
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:58,759
I left the agency out.

253
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,679
I just dug up dirt on the guy,

254
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,959
had friends confirm it

255
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:02,920
gave the press proof.

256
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:04,798
Your fan clubs petitioned the crew

257
00:20:04,799 --> 00:20:06,559
to fire the actor slandering his costars.

258
00:20:06,599 --> 00:20:08,000
He fought with Mr. Zhu, too.

259
00:20:08,079 --> 00:20:09,079
The crew hates him.

260
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,640
So Director Lu fired him on the spot.

261
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:14,079
You're savage.

262
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,640
I like it.

263
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,680
Oh, and

264
00:20:20,799 --> 00:20:23,400
some random guy stood up for you both.

265
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:24,279
Who?

266
00:20:24,319 --> 00:20:26,480
His profile pic showed a guy
in a gold chain.

267
00:20:26,713 --> 00:20:28,032
I was curious, so I messaged him.

268
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,880
He saw someone being picked on.

269
00:20:30,119 --> 00:20:31,558
You ate the wrong popcorn.

270
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:33,440
How could you be as sly as the haters say?

271
00:20:38,119 --> 00:20:39,119
He says to tell you:

272
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:43,558
Theaters have infrared night vision
cameras everywhere.

273
00:20:43,559 --> 00:20:45,400
Stop, stop. Enough. Bye-bye.

274
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,400
Hmph.

275
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,160
Oh, God.

276
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:52,400
Some moments of humiliation

277
00:20:52,799 --> 00:20:54,319
haunt you for life.

278
00:20:56,039 --> 00:20:57,440
So Gu Yiliang

279
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:59,119
wasn't upset about this.

280
00:20:59,799 --> 00:21:00,799
Then what's going on?

281
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,000
Hello?

282
00:21:12,079 --> 00:21:13,160
Hey, Mingming.

283
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,880
I'm drunk. Come get me.

284
00:21:37,599 --> 00:21:38,839
Here you go, Mingming.

285
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:40,400
Have some tea.

286
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,240
Thanks.

287
00:21:48,839 --> 00:21:50,000
It's nothing serious.

288
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:54,359
I just want some advice
on a tiny relationship problem.

289
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,799
I have this friend.

290
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:59,279
His boyfriend's been

291
00:21:59,519 --> 00:22:01,480
a tiny bit distant lately.

292
00:22:01,759 --> 00:22:03,680
Everything else is great.

293
00:22:04,119 --> 00:22:06,799
It's just, in that department,

294
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,000
they haven't done it yet.

295
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,480
So I was wondering

296
00:22:11,559 --> 00:22:14,759
if his boyfriend's gone cold
all of a sudden because...

297
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:16,160
he's still hungry?

298
00:22:16,759 --> 00:22:18,039
Whoa, careful!

299
00:22:25,039 --> 00:22:27,599
What does your friend like about him?

300
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:31,079
What I mean is,

301
00:22:31,279 --> 00:22:34,759
your friend's probably as handsome as you.

302
00:22:35,039 --> 00:22:37,519
Fun to be around. Good career.

303
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:41,720
He could be happy on his own.

304
00:22:42,039 --> 00:22:44,680
Why put himself through all that?

305
00:22:45,119 --> 00:22:48,400
Can you really help who you fall for?

306
00:22:48,799 --> 00:22:50,079
You know what they say.

307
00:22:50,519 --> 00:22:56,079
Love and coughs are
the hardest things to suppress.

308
00:22:56,799 --> 00:22:58,079
What's love worth?

309
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,680
You give it everything,

310
00:23:01,279 --> 00:23:02,039
and in the end,

311
00:23:02,119 --> 00:23:04,599
you become enemies,
or you stay and resent each other.

312
00:23:05,519 --> 00:23:07,640
The deeper you fall, the more it hurts.

313
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:09,839
What if he lets you down?

314
00:23:12,559 --> 00:23:13,559
Sorry.

315
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:15,640
It's okay.

316
00:23:16,279 --> 00:23:17,920
You have a point.

317
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:18,759
It's true.

318
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,799
When you love someone,
you give them your best.

319
00:23:22,319 --> 00:23:24,400
People have played me plenty of times.

320
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,039
But I still think

321
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:30,279
there are plenty of people
who care about you.

322
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:31,079
Look,

323
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:33,920
my parents, my friends, my fans...

324
00:23:34,319 --> 00:23:35,319
and you.

325
00:23:35,559 --> 00:23:36,839
You worry about me, too.

326
00:23:37,640 --> 00:23:38,640
So...

327
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:41,680
If my boyfriend's serious about us,

328
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,319
I'll be sweeter than honey.

329
00:23:43,559 --> 00:23:44,759
If he treats me like crap,

330
00:23:45,119 --> 00:23:46,799
I do know how to throw a punch.

331
00:23:47,599 --> 00:23:48,599
But honestly,

332
00:23:49,119 --> 00:23:50,839
my boyfriend's pretty great.

333
00:23:51,599 --> 00:23:53,079
He's the kind of person

334
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,920
the world kisses with pain,

335
00:23:55,559 --> 00:23:56,920
and he answers it with a song.

336
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:01,319
Gu Yiliang's a lucky man.

337
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,319
Of course.

338
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:04,319
Wait. It's not Gu Yiliang. Or me.

339
00:24:04,519 --> 00:24:05,519
It's my friend.

340
00:24:05,559 --> 00:24:07,920
I was telling it from his point of view.

341
00:24:08,279 --> 00:24:09,279
Right.

342
00:24:10,079 --> 00:24:11,880
If your friend's boyfriend is so great,

343
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:14,720
he's not distant over a lack of sex.

344
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:16,880
Maybe they've been joined at the hip

345
00:24:17,079 --> 00:24:18,480
and gotten too comfortable.

346
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:21,599
Your friend needs to play it cool.

347
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:24,519
Oh, lesson learned.

348
00:24:25,519 --> 00:24:26,519
I'll go...

349
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:27,119
I mean,

350
00:24:27,200 --> 00:24:28,960
I'll tell my friend to swear off sex.

351
00:24:29,519 --> 00:24:33,200
I'll be higher and colder
than the Himalayas.

352
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:35,839
Gu Yiliang isn't Wei Yanzi's sugar daddy.

353
00:24:35,920 --> 00:24:38,839
Wei's family could bankroll ten of him.

354
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:41,880
So that's why rich people
need all that money.

355
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:46,880
To bankroll their lovesick idiot sons.

356
00:24:50,319 --> 00:24:51,160
Mr. Gu.

357
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:53,960
Everything's set up just as you asked.

358
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:56,200
We can start when your guest arrives.

359
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:57,240
Okay.

360
00:24:57,559 --> 00:24:59,319
Call me if you need anything.

361
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:00,960
Thank you.

362
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,000
Of course.

363
00:25:17,599 --> 00:25:18,640
Hey, Yanyan.

364
00:25:19,359 --> 00:25:20,518
How about dinner tonight?

365
00:25:20,519 --> 00:25:21,880
Sorry, Gu Yiliang.

366
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:24,559
Something urgent came up. Tomorrow?

367
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,240
Urgent?

368
00:25:38,640 --> 00:25:39,640
Mr. Cheng.

369
00:25:39,759 --> 00:25:40,759
It really is you.

370
00:25:40,799 --> 00:25:42,279
Please, you have to help me.

371
00:25:42,799 --> 00:25:44,000
Chi Xian?

372
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:45,240
What's he...

373
00:25:50,759 --> 00:25:51,759
I'm Chi Xian.

374
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:54,039
I offended one of your agency's actors.

375
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:56,079
But someone put me up to it.

376
00:25:56,559 --> 00:26:00,720
Now Lan Jue fired me
without a fair hearing.

377
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:03,720
Mr. Cheng,

378
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:04,920
the truth is...

379
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,480
I've admired you for a long time.

380
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:08,839
Could you give me a chance

381
00:26:09,319 --> 00:26:10,319
to...

382
00:26:10,599 --> 00:26:11,599
be with you?

383
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:17,039
Think I run a recycling center?

384
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:20,200
They did you a favor by firing you.

385
00:26:21,279 --> 00:26:22,279
Give it a rest.

386
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:24,039
It'll only hurt more.

387
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:30,240
Can you really help who you fall for?

388
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:31,839
You know what they say.

389
00:26:31,960 --> 00:26:36,079
Love and coughs are
the hardest things to suppress.

390
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:37,640
Mr. Cheng.

391
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:39,160
I told you.

392
00:26:39,359 --> 00:26:40,640
Too many flies around here.

393
00:26:40,799 --> 00:26:42,680
A man has to watch out for himself.

394
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:44,880
Yes, dear husband.

395
00:26:47,559 --> 00:26:48,559
Mr. Cheng...

396
00:26:51,680 --> 00:26:53,079
Haven't left yet?
Quit staring.

397
00:26:53,319 --> 00:26:54,759
Keep staring and I'll call the cops.

398
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:56,480
You...

399
00:26:56,839 --> 00:26:57,839
Get lost!

400
00:27:11,440 --> 00:27:12,440
What are you doing?

401
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:14,880
My husband's jealous.

402
00:27:15,279 --> 00:27:16,279
I'm comforting him.

403
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:18,440
Who's jealous?

404
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:20,799
I was guarding my gold mine.

405
00:27:23,039 --> 00:27:24,200
You didn't deny it.

406
00:27:28,279 --> 00:27:29,960
He was young and obedient.

407
00:27:30,359 --> 00:27:31,440
You're a capitalist.

408
00:27:31,640 --> 00:27:34,160
Why not take him home as your husband?

409
00:27:34,880 --> 00:27:36,880
I don't bargain-hunt for a husband.

410
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:38,640
I choose who I love.

411
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:43,680
What did you say?

412
00:27:49,519 --> 00:27:50,519
I said...

413
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:52,920
I love you.

414
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:21,960
Mr. Gu, what brings you here?

415
00:28:22,039 --> 00:28:22,599
Oh.

416
00:28:22,839 --> 00:28:24,559
I brought Yanyan some cut fruit

417
00:28:24,640 --> 00:28:25,319
and milk tea.

418
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:26,400
Great, thanks.

419
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:28,160
Where is he?

420
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:29,200
Yanyan?

421
00:28:29,279 --> 00:28:29,759
Mm-hm.

422
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:30,759
Oh.

423
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:31,880
Mr. Huang's here.

424
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,160
Yanyan's with him.

425
00:28:34,559 --> 00:28:35,200
Mr. Huang?

426
00:28:35,359 --> 00:28:36,359
Mm-hm.

427
00:28:43,663 --> 00:28:45,170
[Extra Content: Mr. Huang]

428
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,000
Hello?

429
00:28:59,359 --> 00:29:00,519
Hey, son!

430
00:29:00,880 --> 00:29:02,839
How was the shoot today?

431
00:29:03,680 --> 00:29:05,559
My dear Mr. Huang,

432
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:07,519
stop secretly funding the show.

433
00:29:08,559 --> 00:29:10,240
Okay, okay, okay.

434
00:29:10,799 --> 00:29:12,200
And stop sending me money, too.

435
00:29:12,559 --> 00:29:13,839
No, no, no.

436
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:15,119
Do you really have to?

437
00:29:15,359 --> 00:29:17,319
I do, I do, I do.

438
00:29:17,440 --> 00:29:18,559
Stop, stop.

439
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:19,720
Enough, enough.

440
00:29:19,799 --> 00:29:20,839
Bye-bye.

441
00:29:22,799 --> 00:29:23,799
Why so touchy?

442
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:25,359
That kid must be in love.

443
00:29:27,700 --> 00:29:29,200
(Extra 8: Zhu Mingming's Audition)

444
00:29:46,599 --> 00:29:50,240
Our recruit company held a contest
to follow Comrade Lei Feng's example.

445
00:29:50,359 --> 00:29:52,599
We had to do a good deed every day.

446
00:29:53,039 --> 00:29:53,640
But...

447
00:29:53,799 --> 00:29:56,279
everyone else beat me to the good deeds.

448
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:58,240
I was beside myself.

449
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,240
Auntie Lin...

450
00:30:01,759 --> 00:30:04,559
Auntie Lin came by
with a pot of hot soy milk.

451
00:30:04,640 --> 00:30:06,680
I hurried over and took it from her.

452
00:30:07,640 --> 00:30:08,640
Into the vat it went.

453
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:09,640
Now then,

454
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:12,799
Leave the tofu to me, Erhu!
